<section class="section-anchor" id="pathways">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">★ Common processes · Mapped</div>
  <div class="section-heading">Navigating the Government Labyrinth</div>
  <div class="section-sub">Most Philadelphians do this stuff once — or at most a handful of times in their lifetime. We all do the same thing and we all have to figure it out on our own. <em>Here, we curate it.</em></div>
  <div class="gilt-rule"></div>

  <div class="path-card">
    <div class="path-quote">
      "The information is out there. The city has a handful of helpful websites — some help over there, some help over here — and every time I look for something I get exhausted. I think I'm smart. I can't imagine how frustrated you jabronies must get trying to figure out what paperwork you need to file in order to do whatever it is you do. We are a society. We should be helping each other through the labyrinth — in order to form a more perfect Union."
      <span class="signoff">— Why FORA</span>
    </div>

